cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark, harness or data, please cite it as below."
title: "BOAR bench: an open benchmark and harness for offline research assistants"
type: software
version: "1.1.2"
date-released: "2026-10-29"
license: MIT
authors:
  - alias: "r4to"
    name: "r4to, independent researcher"
abstract: >-
  Public questions with frozen frontier-plus-web reference answers, a pairwise judge (both A/B orders),
  a cross-family judge, scorers, a desktop adapter that simulates the phone, arm patches with frozen criteria,
  pre-registered plans and pack self-test sets from the BOAR research on poidh bounty #31.
  The held-out sets are retired and public since v1.1 (bench/heldout/, bench/v0.4/). Data is under CC BY 4.0 and the licences listed in NOTICE;
  code is MIT. Health content is AI-reviewed, not clinically reviewed.
keywords:
  - benchmark
  - offline
  - retrieval-augmented generation
  - on-device LLM
  - evaluation
url: "https://r4topunk.github.io/boar-research/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/r4topunk/boar-bench"
